@base = http://localhost:4000
@origin = http://localhost:4000

# The demo is built by `pnpm db:seed -- --demo`.

### What the demo holds (no session needed)
# @name demo
GET {{base}}/api/v1/demo

###
@workspaceId = {{demo.response.body.data.workspace.id}}
@sourceId = {{demo.response.body.data.sources[0].id}}

### Sign in as a guest (REST Client keeps the session cookie; capped per IP)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/sign-in/anonymous
Content-Type: application/json
Origin: {{origin}}

{}

### Who am I (isGuest: true)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/me

### Start a conversation in the demo
# @name conversation
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/conversations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Demo questions" }

###
@conversationId = {{conversation.response.body.data.id}}

### Ask (streams SSE; guests get a few messages a day per IP)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/conversations/{{conversationId}}/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{ "content": "How does leader-based replication handle a failed follower?" }

### A book page: visitors get a short excerpt (excerpt: true)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/sources/{{sourceId}}/content?page=160

### Search: hits are cut to snippets, no parent sections
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces/{{workspaceId}}/search
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "replication lag", "mode": "keyword" }

### Refused for guests (403)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/workspaces
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mine" }
